    "description": "<p>You brace your weapon for increased impact force as your weapon sits firmly grasped in both hands. For the duration, once per turn when you deal your [Weapons damage] with a Bukijutsu and weapon attack, the affected creature must make a Strength saving throw, gaining 1 rank of Weakened on a failed save.</p>\n<p>Chain 2. Creatures who fail their saving throw by 5 or more are also Dazed.</p>",
